<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-17383] IdleVerify hangs when called on inactive cluster with persistence</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-17383</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When you call &lt;tt&gt;control.sh --cache idle_verify&lt;/tt&gt; on inactive cluster with persistence, control script hangs and no actions are performed. As you can see below in &apos;rest&apos; thread dump, &lt;tt&gt;VerifyBackupPartitionsTaskV2&lt;/tt&gt; waits for checkpoint start in &lt;tt&gt;GridCacheDatabaseSharedManager#waitForCheckpoint&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It seems, that we can interrupt task execution and print message in control script output, that IdleVerify can&apos;t work on inactive cluster.&lt;/p&gt;

